Package: solomonR
Title: Analyze Solomon Four-Group Designs
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joshua", "Uhalt", email = "Josh.Uhalt@gmail.com", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: Tools for analyzing Solomon four-group experimental designs using
    historical Tests A-I, unified generalized linear models with robust
    covariance estimation, stratified randomization inference, full-information
    maximum likelihood, and observed- and latent-variable structural equation
    models. Includes diagnostics, effect sizes, plotting, and teaching-oriented
    workflows that distinguish historical procedures from contemporary
    recommendations.
License: GPL-3
